  "description": "An always-learning neural concurrency tuner for EvalApp. A tiny holographic policy model (HoloFormer, ~0.4ms/decision) tunes resource-gate concurrency online and reacts in real time as conditions change; it ships warm and keeps learning. It matches the built-in heuristic on lean/clean pipelines and beats it on real coupled workloads (~25% faster on a multi-gate DB + disk + CPU benchmark). Opt in with .WithNeuralTuning() on your app.",
